(7014961, 1062541, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Ha! Love the ''What!" grouchy expression with ''the look'' and the raised eyebrow. The annoyance of the man is further heightened by Oscar the Grouch on his t-shirt (nice touch btw:-) ). Processing and the lighting are top notch work. Excellent work - will definitely be in the top ten.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Ha! Love the ''What!" grouchy expression with ''the look'' and the raised eyebrow. The annoyance of the man is further heightened by Oscar the Grouch on his t-shirt (nice touch btw:-) ). Processing and the lighting are top notch work. Excellent work - will definitely be in the top ten.', '2013-04-06 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
